        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(i) \"7-Day Coverage Employee\" means an Employee whose Scheduled Weekly Tour involves special or rotating Scheduled Daily Tours which frequently include working on calendar Saturdays and/or Sundays, and who works on a 7-Day Coverage Job.",
